        <mxCell id="features" value="Key Features:&#xa;• Real-time GPS tracking&#xa;• Dynamic pricing (surge)&#xa;• Fare estimation&#xa;• Multiple ride types&#xa;• In-app payments&#xa;• Navigation &amp; ETA&#xa;• Ratings &amp; reviews&#xa;• Trip history&#xa;• Safety features" style="rounded=1;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;align=left;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1">
